  "title": "· MIU MIU Utility Multi-Pocket Tote ·",
  "original_title": "MIU MIU 多功能口袋 Utilitaire 手提包",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu's SS26 Utilitaire bag reimagines the tool bag in ochre nappa leather with multi-pocket utility detailing.",
