      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Drawn from the humble tool bag, the Miu Miu Utilitaire from the Spring/Summer 2026 runway comes in a roomy silhouette rendered in soft, vintage-tinged ochre nappa calfskin. Its standout feature: a ring of utility-style multi-functional pockets around the exterior, channeling the rebellious, quirky spirit of the Miu Miu girl.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
