    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Multi-Pocket Design ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Titled \"At Work,\" the Miu Miu Spring/Summer 2026 show introduced the new Utilitaire line, inspired by the workman's tool bag. Roomy proportions paired with an array of exterior pockets translate utilitarian function into a modern everyday aesthetic — the name itself means \"practical\" in French.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
