    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Designed by co-creative directors Miuccia Prada and Raf Simons, the bag features a clean, structured rectangular shape with a zip closure. Its headline detail is five functional exterior pockets: a large flap pocket plus a card slot at the front, an open pocket on each side, and a large flap pocket at the back.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
