    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Ochre Leather ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Ochre\" is an earthy tone that falls between reddish-brown and deep brown — reminiscent of chestnut shells or red clay. It reads deep and vintage, evoking a distinctly autumnal mood.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in Tap to enlarge for ultra-sharp viewing",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Crafted from supple nappa calfskin, the leather is tanned and dyed to achieve a vintage, worn-in effect. Its subtle sheen highlights the fine grain, like the patina of years gone by. A tonal leather logo is stitched onto the front, creating a raised, embossed effect that speaks to the handcrafted finish.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in Tap to enlarge for ultra-sharp viewing",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Silver-tone hardware — lobster clasps, rings, and studs — echoes the fittings found on actual tool bags.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
