      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Detachable Strap ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Utilitaire is fitted with twin top handles; the soft leather lets them fall naturally to the sides for a more relaxed feel. They can also be worn over the shoulder for a vintage-chic look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cpfwwf9/4d5c9aeda4a14421.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cpfwwf9/aec7e4a50548460a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "An adjustable, detachable leather strap opens up styling options — slung crossbody it feels effortless and keeps your hands free.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
