    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· What Fits Inside ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The soft nappa calfskin gives the bag flexible, expandable structure, while the distinctive exterior pockets are perfect for grabbing essentials on the go — earphones, keys, cards, tissues and more.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cpfwwf9/76b37399f62f62c6.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cpfwwf9/b25285c79845cf57.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Unzip it and you'll find a dark brown cotton-satin lining and a flat zip pocket, taking organization up another notch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cpfwwf9/b7cfc9bf842e9cd7.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/cpfwwf9/a0a80d8456cd8d20.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We packed ours with over-ear headphones, an iPad, a notebook, a cardholder, keys and a travel perfume — and there's still room for books, a sketchbook, touch-up makeup, a camera and whatever else you need. Whether you're a student, a commuter, a traveler or out shopping with friends, this bag handles it all with ease.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
