    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu is a luxury fashion house from Milan, Italy, founded in 1993 by designer Miuccia Prada. It offers women's ready-to-wear, handbags, footwear, eyewear, fragrance and accessories, with young women as its core clientele. The design team is based in Milan, while its headquarters moved to Paris in 2015. since 1993 from Paris",
